Lighthouse adapts the work of others. What it took, and from whom:

The Seatbelt profile of macOS (crates/lighthouse-process/src/sandbox/seatbelt.rs)
  Its base policy is the one of OpenAI Codex, `seatbelt_base_policy.sbpl`
  (Apache-2.0), itself taken from Chromium's sandbox, cut to what the programs
  Lighthouse runs need. Its reads, writes and network follow Anthropic's
  sandbox-runtime.
